{
  "_comment": "The full tier feat-cmux-next's own head runs once an hour (scripts/ci/hourly_full_tier.py, cmux-next-hourly-full-tier.yml): each workflow here is dispatched with no inputs on feat-cmux-next. It lists the workflows whose full tier a landing head no longer runs (head_tier.py hourly full tier rule) and that neither run on a feat-cmux-next push nor sit in the post-merge batch (.github/post-merge-batch.json); cmux-next.yml's base tier has its own kick (cmux-next-base-tier-kick.yml). `paths` is the workflow's own pull_request paths filter (tests/test_ci_hourly_full_tier.py keeps them equal): a workflow none of whose paths the commits since its last hourly run touched is not dispatched; none means every change reaches it.",
